%% aoneahsan-cccs-react-theming — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Theme work]) --> task{What are you doing?}

    task -->|building the customiser| options[Expose the FULL option set]
    options --> o1[Appearance: light / dark / system]
    o1 --> o2[Accent: 8+ swatches, tooltip,<br/>check on the selected one]
    o2 --> o3[Neutral tone · radius · scaling ·<br/>font size · panel background]
    o3 --> control{How is each option rendered?}
    control -->|dropdown| nodrop[NEVER a dropdown — it hides the<br/>thing being chosen]
    control -->|cards| preview[Cards PREVIEW their own property:<br/>radius cards at their radius,<br/>font cards at their size.<br/>The preview IS the control]
    nodrop --> preview
    preview --> access[Reachable from a header palette icon<br/>for SIGNED-OUT users too.<br/>Scroll area + Reset to defaults]

    task -->|appearance = system| media["Resolve via prefers-color-scheme<br/>WITH a live change listener —<br/>follow the OS when it changes,<br/>not only at load"]

    task -->|persisting| who{Is the user signed in?}
    who -->|no| local[Device storage via the project's<br/>storage layer. NEVER raw localStorage]
    who -->|yes| remote[Backend user record + device cache]
    remote --> signin[On sign-in: fetch remote.<br/>REMOTE WINS. Write back to cache]
    signin --> norow{Did the user have<br/>a stored row?}
    norow -->|no| push[Push current local prefs up so<br/>the server has a row]
    norow -->|yes| debounce
    push --> debounce
    local --> debounce
    debounce[Debounce remote writes >=500ms —<br/>dragging through swatches must not<br/>become a write per frame]
    debounce --> signout[On sign-out: KEEP local values.<br/>The device shows the last choice]

    task -->|app flashes the<br/>wrong theme| gate[/🔴 HYDRATION GATE/]
    gate --> both{Held until BOTH store rehydrated<br/>AND auth resolved?}
    both -->|no| addgate[Hold first paint behind the boot loader.<br/>Theme alone is not enough — auth<br/>resolving later causes a second flash]
    both -->|yes| tokens
    addgate --> tokens

    access --> tokens
    media --> tokens
    signout --> tokens
    tokens{Does any component read the<br/>theme store to pick a colour,<br/>or hardcode a hex?}
    tokens -->|yes| fixtokens[Replace with a token.<br/>Hardcoded values are invisible<br/>to every option above]
    tokens -->|no| verify
    fixtokens --> verify

    verify([Verify EVERY surface against EVERY<br/>option — each accent, radius and scale,<br/>not just light vs dark])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class task,control,who,norow,both,tokens gateNode
    class trigger,verify terminal
    class nodrop,gate warn
